    dict(key='13-act-5', kind='console', title='Act Five — The bill, at a thousand stations',
         body='FIVE. The bill, at a thousand stations.\n  1,000 stations: 11 levels, finding a station takes 9.7 hops on average (the stopping service: 500.5)\n  2,031 arrows: about 2 per station instead of 1\n  already in Java: java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentSkipListMap',
         narration='And the bill, at a thousand stations. [[slnc 400]] The fair coin builds eleven levels. [[slnc 400]] A search takes nine point seven hops on average. [[slnc 300]] The stopping service would take five hundred. [[slnc 500]] The price is memory: about two arrows per station, instead of one. [[slnc 400]] And the speed is an average, not a promise.'),
